# creativity-techniques-pedagogy — research home

Mirror of `digital-creativity-pedagogy/` **structure**, not a copy of foreign CER claims or Cursor stack.

## Layout

| Path | Role |
| ---- | ---- |
| [`cv/guides/*.json`](./cv/guides/) | **Mandatory** official UEM guía clones |
| [`oficial-guia-framework.mdc`](./oficial-guia-framework.mdc) | How hours, evaluation, competencies, CONTENIDOS bind all pedagogy |
| *(future)* `ct-cv-forge.mdc` | Forge instructor CV / guía curricular from JSON |
| *(future)* `ct-unit-forge.mdc` | One unit → lesson + studio + exercises |
| [`grounding/`](./grounding/) | Field map, authorities, lexicum · discover/cite rules |
| [`TEACHING-READINESS.mdc`](./TEACHING-READINESS.mdc) | Honest “can we teach yet?” audit |
| [`cv/`](./cv/) | Guides (PDF-patched) + CV drafts + [`cv/UNIT-PLAN.md`](./cv/UNIT-PLAN.md) |
| [`consent/`](./consent/) | C-set + S-set drafts (not DPO-approved, not on Pages) |
| [`forge/`](./forge/) | Unit/session forge prompts *(future)* |

## Critical layer (not CONTENIDOS)

Media vocabulary includes **C1–C3**: ideology; labour; GenAI authorship. These inform lesson framing and media-prospector tags — they are **not** official guía content rows.

